# Xcode
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/

# SwiftPM local build cache (MissionControlKit's own `swift build`/`swift test` artifacts —
# the Xcode project resolves the package independently into its own DerivedData)
MissionControlKit/.build/
MissionControlKit/.swiftpm/

# `MissionControl.xcodeproj` and `Generated/*.plist` ARE committed (not gitignored):
# ADR-0011's "Cmd-R is the whole deploy loop" means a fresh checkout must build without
# requiring `xcodegen generate` first. `project.yml` stays the source of truth for
# structural changes — regenerate with `xcodegen generate` after editing it, then commit
# the result.

# PostHog Project API Key + ingestion host (infrastructure-pht7k; see the ADR amending
# ADR-0010's storage clause). Never committed — the `project.yml` MissionControl target's
# postBuildScripts entry sources this at build time and injects the two values into the *built*
# Info.plist via PlistBuddy, never into a committed file. Create this file locally with:
#   POSTHOG_API_KEY=phc_...
#   POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
# Absent (e.g. CI, or before first populated): the app falls back to a no-op analytics logger,
# see `AnalyticsEventLoggerFactory` in `MissionControl/PostHogAnalyticsEventLogger.swift`.
.env
